# This repository is public. Real course material is never committed:
# source files, the pictures taken from them, and the questions and answer
# keys themselves stay on the machine that built them.
#
# A pattern with a slash in it is tied to this folder, so the two folder rules
# need the leading **/ to reach a bank several levels down.
**/source/*
**/assets/*
questions.json
questions.docx
!.gitkeep

# The invented bank is the one exception: every word and picture in it was
# made up for the tests.
!/synthetic/**
